{"title":"2019 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_fully_understand_the_problem!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_The_Power_of_Logic(1_to_25_Full_Solution)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by The Power of Logic(1 to 25 Full Solution)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/e/87edbdda753b32453027dc7cab023c0743b6b243.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$81$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> grid points (uniformly spaced) in the square shown in the diagram below, including the points on the edges. Point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is in the center of the square. Given that point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> is randomly chosen among the other <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea5fcc6d66685ee21f722efcd228eb44d38f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> points, what is the probability that the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/b/7ab17967324fc2b12349c0610c6c256f4c829162.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> is a line of symmetry for the square?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2ef50880b9e105fcb40568742659a26c359c6c1a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(0,8)); draw((0,8)--(8,8)); draw((8,8)--(8,0)); draw((8,0)--(0,0)); dot((0,0)); dot((0,1)); dot((0,2)); dot((0,3)); dot((0,4)); dot((0,5)); dot((0,6)); dot((0,7)); dot((0,8));  dot((1,0)); dot((1,1)); dot((1,2)); dot((1,3)); dot((1,4)); dot((1,5)); dot((1,6)); dot((1,7)); dot((1,8));  dot((2,0)); dot((2,1)); dot((2,2)); dot((2,3)); dot((2,4)); dot((2,5)); dot((2,6)); dot((2,7)); dot((2,8));  dot((3,0)); dot((3,1)); dot((3,2)); dot((3,3)); dot((3,4)); dot((3,5)); dot((3,6)); dot((3,7)); dot((3,8));  dot((4,0)); dot((4,1)); dot((4,2)); dot((4,3)); dot((4,4)); dot((4,5)); dot((4,6)); dot((4,7)); dot((4,8));  dot((5,0)); dot((5,1)); dot((5,2)); dot((5,3)); dot((5,4)); dot((5,5)); dot((5,6)); dot((5,7)); dot((5,8));  dot((6,0)); dot((6,1)); dot((6,2)); dot((6,3)); dot((6,4)); dot((6,5)); dot((6,6)); dot((6,7)); dot((6,8));  dot((7,0)); dot((7,1)); dot((7,2)); dot((7,3)); dot((7,4)); dot((7,5)); dot((7,6)); dot((7,7)); dot((7,8));  dot((8,0)); dot((8,1)); dot((8,2)); dot((8,3)); dot((8,4)); dot((8,5)); dot((8,6)); dot((8,7)); dot((8,8)); label(&quot;P&quot;,(4,4),NE); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/f/b2fcf612859a1c61d6eec57ea718507f755b5df9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\frac{1}{5}\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }\\frac{1}{4} \\qquad\\textbf{(C) }\\frac{2}{5} \\qquad\\textbf{(D) }\\frac{9}{20} \\qquad\\textbf{(E) }\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"381\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/b/63bb33b68c197515f7d5cad4846e01b08f4fe558.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(0,8)); draw((0,8)--(8,8)); draw((8,8)--(8,0)); draw((8,0)--(0,0)); dot((0,0)); dot((0,1)); dot((0,2)); dot((0,3)); dot((0,4)); dot((0,5)); dot((0,6)); dot((0,7)); dot((0,8));  dot((1,0)); dot((1,1)); dot((1,2)); dot((1,3)); dot((1,4)); dot((1,5)); dot((1,6)); dot((1,7)); dot((1,8));  dot((2,0)); dot((2,1)); dot((2,2)); dot((2,3)); dot((2,4)); dot((2,5)); dot((2,6)); dot((2,7)); dot((2,8));  dot((3,0)); dot((3,1)); dot((3,2)); dot((3,3)); dot((3,4)); dot((3,5)); dot((3,6)); dot((3,7)); dot((3,8));  dot((4,0)); dot((4,1)); dot((4,2)); dot((4,3)); dot((4,4)); dot((4,5)); dot((4,6)); dot((4,7)); dot((4,8));  dot((5,0)); dot((5,1)); dot((5,2)); dot((5,3)); dot((5,4)); dot((5,5)); dot((5,6)); dot((5,7)); dot((5,8));  dot((6,0)); dot((6,1)); dot((6,2)); dot((6,3)); dot((6,4)); dot((6,5)); dot((6,6)); dot((6,7)); dot((6,8));  dot((7,0)); dot((7,1)); dot((7,2)); dot((7,3)); dot((7,4)); dot((7,5)); dot((7,6)); dot((7,7)); dot((7,8));  dot((8,0)); dot((8,1)); dot((8,2)); dot((8,3)); dot((8,4)); dot((8,5)); dot((8,6)); dot((8,7)); dot((8,8)); label(&quot;P&quot;,(4,4),NE); draw((0,4)--(3,4)); draw((0,8)--(3,5)); draw((8,8)--(5,5)); draw((4,8)--(4,5)); draw((4,0)--(4,3)); draw((0,0)--(3,3)); draw((8,0)--(5,3)); draw((5,4)--(8,4)); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"252\" />\nLines of symmetry go through point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> directions the lines could go, and there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> dots at each direction.<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/3/d63734ce6155281f6510fecb49ef093d064bdbe4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4\\times8}{80}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)} \\frac{2}{5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"122\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Divide the grid into 4 4x5 quadrants. Each row of 5 points has 1 point on a horizontal/vertical line of symmetry + 1 point on a diagonal line of symmetry: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/8/e28329137a0fce60d9a390eb0dba52f48855abff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)} \\frac{2}{5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"55\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_.28First_fully_understand_the_problem.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_fully_understand_the_problem!!!)\">Video Solution by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/IgpayYB48C4?si=AdzSEy4Ocrte4gEU&amp;t=1650\">https://youtu.be/IgpayYB48C4?si=AdzSEy4Ocrte4gEU&amp;t=1650</a>\n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/PizqK-oBLqk\">https://youtu.be/PizqK-oBLqk</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The Learning Royal&#160;: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/8njQzoztDGc\">https://youtu.be/8njQzoztDGc</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_4\">Video Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solution detailing how to solve the problem: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4L95z9DwlhI&amp;list=PLbhMrFqoXXwmwbk2CWeYOYPRbGtmdPUhL&amp;index=7\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4L95z9DwlhI&amp;list=PLbhMrFqoXXwmwbk2CWeYOYPRbGtmdPUhL&amp;index=7</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_5\">Video Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/TAKmC11vitM\">https://youtu.be/TAKmC11vitM</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_The_Power_of_Logic.281_to_25_Full_Solution.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_The_Power_of_Logic(1_to_25_Full_Solution)\">Video Solution by The Power of Logic(1 to 25 Full Solution)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by The Power of Logic(1 to 25 Full Solution)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Xm4ZGND9WoY\">https://youtu.be/Xm4ZGND9WoY</a>\n</p><p>~Hayabusa1\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8\" title=\"2019 AMC 8\">2019 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2019 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2019 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2019\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2019 