ems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017032435\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 149/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2268/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 128/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4779/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.058      1 -total\n 57.89%    6.980      1 Template:AMC8_box\n 40.40%    4.871      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:17850:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017032435 and revision id 271763. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}